Package: tubeos-installer
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-qrcode, parted, rsync, grub-efi-amd64-bin | grub-pc, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, arch-install-scripts
Maintainer: Pulsar OS Team <team@pulsaros.io>
Description: Tube OS Web Installer
 Web-based installer for Tube OS. Provides a browser-accessible
 interface for installing Tube OS to disk and initial configuration
 (timezone, keyboard, user creation). Runs headless - no HDMI needed,
 just ethernet + browser.
